# Origin of the Django API (no trailing slash), read at build time. Leave empty in development:
# Vite proxies /api to API_PROXY_TARGET (default http://127.0.0.1:8000). In production set it to
# the deployed API, e.g. https://safe-route-api.onrender.com.
VITE_API_URL=
# API_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000
